                    <div class="submission__content flow-slim">
              <div class="submission__body break-text text-flow"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">I have an iPhone 12 that is almost two years old. The battery health is now 76% percent. Other than the battery, the machine works great. I think I will keep this phone for another two years or so. I wonder if it is worth changing the battery with Apple, a 3rd party service provider, or any other options. I don't know how much each option is worth and what effect it has when I trade the iPhone 12 in for the new one when it comes.</p>
<p lang="en" dir="ltr">p.s. I am in Mainland China if that matters for the service options.</p>
</div>
